# Installed as <install folder>\.dockerignore by the RR Trading One installer (desktop/scripts/stage_bundle.py).
# The install folder is the Docker build context of compose.yml (context: ..). Only the engine sources the images
# copy are sent to Docker: the desktop app, the MT5 connector and everything else in the folder stay out.
# (Dockerfiles are read by Docker even when excluded here.) Not used by the repository's own builds.
*
!backend
!frontend
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
frontend/node_modules
frontend/.next
